[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [ ] [38;5;153mLint + format (eslint + prettier)[39m
         [38;5;246mCatches the load-order and async mistakes this design is most exposed to. Adds devDependencies to a currently [39m
         [38;5;246mdependency-free project.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Unit tests (runner + first test)
         [38;5;246mA runner, a test layout, and one passing test for AppSession. Makes the storage-degrades-gracefully behavior [39m
         [38;5;246mverifiable rather than asserted.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
         [38;5;246mBrowser-driven test of the actual login submit flow. Highest confidence, heaviest setup for an app this size.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] None — keep it dependency-free
         [38;5;246mLeave package.json as is. Fastest, but nothing verifies the session behavior automatically.[39m
